(7739152, 1275989, 97225, '<td valign="top">I love this! 9</td>', 'I love this! 9', '2023-02-26 20:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739153, 1276164, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fully awesome image, with great drama, clarity and colors.  The clipped wings forces us to confront the content rather than grace and splendor.  They both seem to be under a microscope, both given primacy, yet one lives and one dies.  Their eyes are the same, as are their vibrant presences.  And yet, from our safe and soft perspective, we can recognize the overall pattern woven by nature, the scintillation of life and death, all in their turn.  Actually, it''s thrust upon us to look or look away.<br/>Wonderful.  Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Fully awesome image, with great drama, clarity and colors.  The clipped wings forces us to confront the content rather than grace and splendor.  They both seem to be under a microscope, both given primacy, yet one lives and one dies.  Their eyes are the same, as are their vibrant presences.  And yet, from our safe and soft perspective, we can recognize the overall pattern woven by nature, the scintillation of life and death, all in their turn.  Actually, it''s thrust upon us to look or look away.Wonderful.  Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2023-02-26 20:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739154, 1276190, 97225, '<td valign="top">Awesome! (I''m sure it is a roaring fire, too). 9</td>', 'Awesome! (I''m sure it is a roaring fire, too). 9', '2023-02-26 20:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739155, 1276144, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured. 9</td>', 'Beautifully captured. 9', '2023-02-26 20:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739156, 1276144, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely, elucidating image.  The insect is pared down to its essentials, eye, wing and leg.  This is accomplished through a judiciosly shallow depth of field, and great touch.  If we didn''t know about insects we wouldn''t know what in the world to make of it, being so crazy indecipherable.  Black and white does this well.  Very artful.<br/>Personal second favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely, elucidating image.  The insect is pared down to its essentials, eye, wing and leg.  This is accomplished through a judiciosly shallow depth of field, and great touch.  If we didn''t know about insects we wouldn''t know what in the world to make of it, being so crazy indecipherable.  Black and white does this well.  Very artful.Personal second favorite of the challenge.', '2023-02-26 21:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739159, 1276190, 173844, '<td valign="top">Directly presented huge fire, as is more and more wont to occur.  Thank you .... well, I''ll forego the bitterness.  There''s a certain grandeur here, nevertheless, in addition to the heartbreak.  What''s really fascinating to me is how the orange glow comingles with the night sky.  The deep field leading to the line of trees is a strong participant in the interesting composition.  Fine testimony.</td>', 'Directly presented huge fire, as is more and more wont to occur.  Thank you .... well, I''ll forego the bitterness.  There''s a certain grandeur here, nevertheless, in addition to the heartbreak.  What''s really fascinating to me is how the orange glow comingles with the night sky.  The deep field leading to the line of trees is a strong participant in the interesting composition.  Fine testimony.', '2023-02-26 21:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739163, 1275989, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully seen.  The shy intimacy of the ducks, amidst the swirling, radiant water,  plays out before a delicate backdrop of plants and starlike highlights.  We are privileged to see this moment.  Nice sepia treatment.<br/>An additional personal second favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderfully seen.  The shy intimacy of the ducks, amidst the swirling, radiant water,  plays out before a delicate backdrop of plants and starlike highlights.  We are privileged to see this moment.  Nice sepia treatment.An additional personal second favorite of the challenge.', '2023-02-26 21:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739164, 1276184, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine far-seeing image.  Wonderful light.</td>', 'Fine far-seeing image.  Wonderful light.', '2023-02-26 21:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739166, 1276173, 173844, '<td valign="top">Moving, perfectly presented image.  Impeccable precision.  I so much want to believe this.  Maybe I can.</td>', 'Moving, perfectly presented image.  Impeccable precision.  I so much want to believe this.  Maybe I can.', '2023-02-26 21:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739168, 1276166, 173844, '<td valign="top">Special, illuminating view of the Milky Way.  Great contrast between our important lives on this planet and the unfathomable immensity of our galaxy, no less the entire universe.  Even so, there''s a sense of balance here, because likely this is it for us.<br/>Fascinating, thought-provoking image.</td>', 'Special, illuminating view of the Milky Way.  Great contrast between our important lives on this planet and the unfathomable immensity of our galaxy, no less the entire universe.  Even so, there''s a sense of balance here, because likely this is it for us.Fascinating, thought-provoking image.', '2023-02-26 21:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739169, 1276176, 173844, '<td valign="top">Picturesque, storybook image, done justice by this deep treatment and confident composition.  It seems possible to walk all the through here and beyond.  The clouds and their reflections form a subtle frame.  A pleasure to look at.</td>', 'Picturesque, storybook image, done justice by this deep treatment and confident composition.  It seems possible to walk all the through here and beyond.  The clouds and their reflections form a subtle frame.  A pleasure to look at.', '2023-02-26 21:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739171, 1276004, 173844, '<td valign="top">Iconic silhouette nicely photographed.  Nice composition.  Can''t do this any better.</td>', 'Iconic silhouette nicely photographed.  Nice composition.  Can''t do this any better.', '2023-02-26 22:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739172, 1276107, 173844, '<td valign="top">Over-the-top adorable girl.  Fine processing, soft and grainy (to my eyes).  Directly seeing us, or actually the photographer.  Confident and challenging.  Perhaps Godzilla is signature.</td>', 'Over-the-top adorable girl.  Fine processing, soft and grainy (to my eyes).  Directly seeing us, or actually the photographer.  Confident and challenging.  Perhaps Godzilla is signature.', '2023-02-26 22:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739173, 1276174, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific feeling of the oncoming storm.  It''s in the light and the roiling clouds.  Exhilirating and, possibly, dangerous.  Then the far skies are fair.  Here''s something you just accept.  The approaching rain is beautifully expressed.  Becoming, unusual composition.  Strong image.</td>', 'Terrific feeling of the oncoming storm.  It''s in the light and the roiling clouds.  Exhilirating and, possibly, dangerous.  Then the far skies are fair.  Here''s something you just accept.  The approaching rain is beautifully expressed.  Becoming, unusual composition.  Strong image.', '2023-02-26 22:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739174, 1276139, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely, domesticated winter scene.  The surrounding rock walls lend a coziness to it all.  It''s good to have a home in this weather.</td>', 'Lovely, domesticated winter scene.  The surrounding rock walls lend a coziness to it all.  It''s good to have a home in this weather.', '2023-02-26 22:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
